  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon has ratified 7 of 10 Fundamental Conventions (29, 98,100, 105, 111, 138, 182), two Governance Conventions (C081, 122) and 42 Technical Conventions.  The Ministry of Labour was able to submit several pending reports on conventions in September.
During the biennium, ILO office will provide support to the constituents in for the implementation as well as ratification of International Labour Conventions.</narrative>
  </description>
